\p{The eigenvalues at this equilibrium are the stable pair of
\ref{fnip-0037}. \ref{fnip-0043} supplies a homeomorphism of a
neighborhood carrying the nonlinear orbits onto the linear orbits.
The drawing records the two orbits that start at the same
displacement.}
